ult; OR a built-in name OR a path to a custom .onnx/.tflite</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">    </span><span class=\"token key atrule\">inference_framework</span><span class=\"token punctuation\" style=\"color:rgb(248, 248, 242)\">:</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token string\" style=\"color:rgb(255, 121, 198)\">&quot;&quot;</span><span class=\"token plain\">   </span><span class=\"token comment\" style=\"color:rgb(98, 114, 164)\"># &quot;&quot; (auto) | &quot;onnx&quot; | &quot;tflite&quot;</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">  </span><span class=\"token key atrule\">porcupine</span><span class=\"token punctuation\" style=\"color:rgb(248, 248, 242)\">:</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">    </span><span class=\"token key atrule\">keyword</span><span class=\"token punctuation\" style=\"color:rgb(248, 248, 242)\">:</span><span class=\"token plain\"> jarvis           </span><span class=\"token comment\" style=\"color:rgb(98, 114, 164)\"># built-in keyword OR path to a custom .ppn</span><br></div></code></pre>","<pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-yaml codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36\"><code class=\"codeBlockLines_e6Vv\"><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">wake_word</span><span class=\"token punctuation\" style=\"color:rgb(248, 248, 242)\">:</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">  </span><span class=\"token key atrule\">enabled</span><span class=\"token punctuation\" style=\"color:rgb(248, 248, 242)\">:</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token boolean 